WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.711
Graph neural networks rely on large amounts of
labeled data,

00:00:03.791 --> 00:00:05.354
which is costly to obtain.

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:10.220
Active learning cuts this cost by selecting the
most valuable nodes to label.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:15.149
But every prior method assumes an oracle can always
name a node's exact class.

00:00:15.229 --> 00:00:18.498
When categories are many or the domain is unfamiliar,

00:00:18.578 --> 00:00:23.680
that multi-class question is too demanding, and the
budget is spent inefficiently.
